    "en": [
      "A vintage black‑and‑white postcard showing a long masonry dam curving across a reservoir in a hilly, forested landscape. The dam has stone towers and a pedestrian walkway with railings running along the crest. At the top of the image, printed in red German text, it reads \"Chemnitzer Talsperre Neunzehnhain.\" A handwritten red number appears in the upper right corner."
